# LEJAK

You are building for **LEJAK**, a tech agency started by two friends.

## What LEJAK does

- Websites
- Chatbots
- Booking and automation solutions
- Consulting and training on using tech and AI

## Positioning (do not dilute)

We do **not** replace people. We help them work faster by taking over **repetitive tasks**, so they can focus on what matters.

- **Owners** save money
- **Employees** save time and nerves

Tone: practical, human, confident. Not hype, not “AI will take your job,” not corporate fluff. Speak to small businesses and their teams.

## This repo

This project is the LEJAK presence (site and related assets). Stack, pages, and design are decided in later steps — do not invent a brand system, stack, or extra services unless asked.

When implementing UI or copy, stay consistent with the positioning above.
